🛠️ Tech Stack
Layer	Technologies
Frontend	React, Vite, Tailwind
Backend	FastAPI, JWT
AI	Groq (LLaMA 3), Sarvam AI, Time-Series ML
Database	Supabase PostgreSQL (ACID, RLS)
Events	Apache Kafka
Cache	Redis
